WEBVTT

01:26.710 --> 01:29.690
[Glory]

01:30.600 --> 01:32.920
[Episode 13]

01:53.509 --> 01:54.070
My Lord.

01:55.509 --> 01:56.440
It's gone wrong.

01:57.070 --> 01:58.229
You chose the daily route

01:58.229 --> 01:59.229
Miss Rong takes

01:59.840 --> 02:00.310
because you wanted to

02:00.310 --> 02:01.770
get close to Rong Shanbao.

02:01.920 --> 02:04.510
Everything happened
just as you predicted,
My Lord.

02:04.510 --> 02:05.710
After your accident,

02:05.790 --> 02:06.820
no one dared to investigate

02:06.820 --> 02:08.419
the Wei family case anymore.

02:08.710 --> 02:10.870
I offered a pair of precious pearls
as a gift

02:10.870 --> 02:12.080
and revealed several of

02:12.080 --> 02:14.210
your mistakes as my pledge of loyalty.

02:14.240 --> 02:16.079
Xu Song accepted my surrender

02:16.240 --> 02:17.560
and entrusted me with important tasks,

02:17.560 --> 02:19.090
promoting me all the way up.

02:19.210 --> 02:20.750
You successfully infiltrated
the Rong family

02:20.750 --> 02:22.210
and won Miss Rong's favor.

02:22.360 --> 02:24.890
Cracking the Wei family case
is within sight.

02:24.910 --> 02:27.040
His Majesty will surely
reward you generously.

02:27.040 --> 02:28.700
Nothing seems bad at the time.

02:29.030 --> 02:30.430
If I hadn't hit that sharp rock

02:30.430 --> 02:31.630
and injured my brain,

02:32.400 --> 02:33.400
the situation wouldn't have become

02:33.400 --> 02:34.329
so complicated.

02:35.829 --> 02:36.870
I'm no deity

02:38.120 --> 02:40.450
who can foresee everything under heaven.

02:43.360 --> 02:45.280
It's all because I was too arrogant,

02:45.280 --> 02:46.940
so heaven played a trick on me.

02:47.870 --> 02:48.960
I wove my own net

02:49.870 --> 02:51.520
only to trap myself in it.

02:53.030 --> 02:53.630
My Lord, are you worried about

02:53.630 --> 02:54.890
Yang Dingchen's case?

02:55.190 --> 02:56.680
Please rest assured, My Lord.

02:56.680 --> 02:58.710
Once we find the owner of
those embroidered shoes,

02:58.710 --> 03:00.590
the case will be solved.

03:09.430 --> 03:10.190
Yunshu.

03:10.710 --> 03:11.400
You know I've

03:11.400 --> 03:13.060
always cared for you the most.

03:13.590 --> 03:15.910
It's all Mr. He's fault
for flattering me so much.

03:15.910 --> 03:17.640
I couldn't resist for a moment.

03:18.120 --> 03:19.400
It's my fault.

03:20.000 --> 03:22.120
I'll find you a better match
in the future.

03:22.120 --> 03:23.380
Please don't blame me.

03:26.440 --> 03:27.370
How would I dare?

03:27.960 --> 03:29.760
Mr. He comes from a noble family.

03:30.310 --> 03:31.840
How could I be worthy of him?

03:32.850 --> 03:35.730
Xiangling, I have a headache.

03:37.890 --> 03:39.550
I have some medicine for headaches.

03:39.550 --> 03:40.410
It's perfect for your symptoms.

03:40.410 --> 03:41.740
Guaranteed to cure you.

03:41.840 --> 03:42.570
Come with me.

03:54.240 --> 03:55.030
Yunyin.

03:55.430 --> 03:57.690
What are you thinking about so intently?

03:59.560 --> 04:01.250
I think I've seen the mark
on the shoe soles

04:01.250 --> 04:02.600
somewhere before.

04:07.140 --> 04:09.010
[Hualin Courtyard]

04:24.680 --> 04:25.240
Shanbao!

04:26.480 --> 04:27.480
Shanbao, help me!

04:30.000 --> 04:30.720
Shanbao.

04:33.270 --> 04:34.390
Shanbao!

04:50.750 --> 04:51.390
Miss Rong.

04:51.800 --> 04:53.190
All your account books and belongings

04:53.190 --> 04:55.250
have been moved to Hualin Courtyard.

05:06.800 --> 05:07.400
Miss Rong.

05:08.700 --> 05:10.270
Lady Yunwan made a scene
for half the night,

05:10.270 --> 05:11.530
crying for Mrs. Liang.

05:11.720 --> 05:12.310
The entire back courtyard

05:12.310 --> 05:13.640
was turned upside down.

05:13.720 --> 05:15.630
She only settled down late at night.

05:15.630 --> 05:17.070
When I just closed my eyes,

05:17.070 --> 05:18.530
Lady Yunwan disappeared.

05:19.510 --> 05:20.070
Mrs. Qiu.

05:20.870 --> 05:21.720
Have two people watch over Yunwan

05:21.720 --> 05:23.750
without leaving her side for a moment.

05:23.750 --> 05:25.270
Don't let strangers frighten her.

05:25.270 --> 05:25.870
Yes.

05:27.390 --> 05:29.070
Miss Rong! Miss Rong!

05:31.950 --> 05:33.280
How can this be my fault?

05:34.790 --> 05:36.520
Lady Yunwan is so unstable,

05:38.040 --> 05:40.240
who could possibly keep watch over her?

05:54.040 --> 05:55.770
Miss Rong, please don't worry.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.520
I've burned those shoes,

05:57.750 --> 05:59.010
so they won't be found.

05:59.159 --> 06:01.160
Do you think Lady Yunwan

06:01.390 --> 06:02.920
might have seen something?

06:10.560 --> 06:12.560
Wanwan was about to find Mrs. Liang.

06:13.240 --> 06:14.160
She must have stumbled upon

06:14.160 --> 06:15.420
Yang Dingchen's death

06:16.160 --> 06:17.290
and got frightened.

06:17.630 --> 06:19.560
Fortunately,
you weren't in the room that night.

06:19.560 --> 06:20.220
Otherwise,

06:20.440 --> 06:22.840
the Yang family would have implicated you.

06:22.950 --> 06:23.870
How can you be sure the murderer

06:23.870 --> 06:25.800
only wanted to kill Yang Dingchen?

06:26.190 --> 06:28.850
What if he specifically chose
our wedding night

06:31.680 --> 06:33.159
to kill me as well?

06:34.480 --> 06:35.080
Miss Rong.

07:41.710 --> 07:42.470
Miss Rong.

07:42.810 --> 07:44.380
[Madam Yang]

07:43.000 --> 07:44.510
Is Wanwan throwing another tantrum

07:44.510 --> 07:45.800
because she can't see me?

07:44.640 --> 07:45.909
[Mrs. Liang]

07:46.150 --> 07:47.710
Did she sleep well at night?

07:48.150 --> 07:50.480
I'm afraid no one
can watch over her properly.

07:50.480 --> 07:51.750
When can I go out?

07:52.270 --> 07:54.000
I just want to take a quick look.

07:54.240 --> 07:55.270
I miss her.

07:56.950 --> 07:58.070
I'll be careful.

07:58.070 --> 07:59.670
I won't let them see me again.

08:00.600 --> 08:03.480
Godmother,
people from your family is here.

08:04.690 --> 08:06.290
It's your brother this time.

08:06.810 --> 08:09.420
Do you want to see him?

08:10.950 --> 08:11.600
No, no, no!

08:12.240 --> 08:13.000
No, no!

08:13.070 --> 08:13.480
No!

08:13.870 --> 08:14.750
I won't go out.

08:14.750 --> 08:15.350
Miss Rong.

08:15.510 --> 08:16.480
I'll never dare again!

08:16.480 --> 08:17.940
Please don't let me go out.

08:17.950 --> 08:19.430
I won't go out.

08:19.430 --> 08:21.680
Godmother, please get up.

08:24.600 --> 08:26.070
You can't hide forever,

08:27.120 --> 08:28.920
without seeing daylight again.

09:01.680 --> 09:02.880
Let me wash your feet.

09:04.750 --> 09:06.670
You ungrateful, disobedient thing!

09:06.670 --> 09:08.600
Are you trying to scald me to death?

09:09.660 --> 09:10.180
Mother.

09:13.720 --> 09:14.320
Why have you upset

09:14.320 --> 09:15.120
Mother again?

09:15.240 --> 09:17.570
She's disrespectful and contradicts me.

09:17.720 --> 09:19.000
You are my son,

09:19.270 --> 09:21.000
so you must teach her a good lesson.

09:21.000 --> 09:21.550
Mother.

09:35.630 --> 09:37.390
Go on, go!

09:38.900 --> 09:39.930
Quickly, go!

09:40.910 --> 09:43.170
Not long after I married into the family,

09:43.960 --> 09:45.460
I accidentally discovered my mother-in-law

09:45.460 --> 09:46.460
having an affair.

09:47.870 --> 09:49.240
She forced me to sleep with her lover,

09:49.240 --> 09:50.300
and when I refused,

09:50.790 --> 09:52.670
she incited Wei Kejian to beat me.

09:54.910 --> 09:56.440
I passed out several times.

09:57.790 --> 09:59.450
Each time, he would revive me,

10:00.530 --> 10:03.730
begging me to understand
he couldn't disobey his mother.

10:04.650 --> 10:05.910
After all these years,

10:07.420 --> 10:08.820
whenever I close my eyes,

10:09.670 --> 10:10.440
I can still smell

10:10.440 --> 10:12.630
the badger oil used to treat my wounds.

10:13.870 --> 10:16.390
Yes, he was a kind-hearted man.

10:16.720 --> 10:17.920
He was forced into it.

10:18.910 --> 10:20.510
But did I deserve to die?

10:21.270 --> 10:22.910
What did I do wrong?

10:25.120 --> 10:26.380
You did nothing wrong.

10:26.600 --> 10:27.910
I had begged Father

10:27.910 --> 10:28.910
and my brothers.

10:29.480 --> 10:31.140
I pleaded with them to save me.

10:32.270 --> 10:33.360
But they just said

10:34.390 --> 10:36.030
it was my bad fate,

10:37.080 --> 10:38.680
and I could change my husband

10:38.720 --> 10:40.200
and his mom's attitude towards me.

10:40.200 --> 10:41.960
As long as I'm willing to endure

10:41.960 --> 10:43.160
and obey everything,

10:43.550 --> 10:45.270
even hearts of stone

10:45.750 --> 10:47.000
can be moved.

10:48.030 --> 10:50.090
They would treat me well eventually.

10:52.390 --> 10:56.440
But I can't bear it. I can't bear it.

10:57.790 --> 10:58.990
Only the Rong family,

10:59.320 --> 11:00.250
and your mother,

11:00.320 --> 11:01.550
who was my dearest friend,

11:01.550 --> 11:03.030
my only hope.

11:03.480 --> 11:05.000
Only she would help me,

11:06.510 --> 11:08.630
but now she's dead too.

11:09.630 --> 11:10.670
She's dead.

11:11.480 --> 11:13.630
You're my only hope now.

11:13.790 --> 11:15.320
Please save me.

11:15.750 --> 11:19.440
Save me, please save me.

11:37.320 --> 11:37.920
Miss Rong!

11:39.270 --> 11:39.870
Miss Rong!

11:40.150 --> 11:42.280
Steward Lu was taken away by Lord Lang.

11:45.650 --> 11:46.910
Greetings, Miss Rong.

12:05.290 --> 12:05.960
Did that Lord Lang

12:05.960 --> 12:07.160
give you any trouble?

12:22.290 --> 12:22.720
No.

12:24.790 --> 12:26.250
Then what did he say to you?

12:27.440 --> 12:28.970
You've successfully
infiltrated the Rong family

12:28.970 --> 12:30.600
and gained Miss Rong's favor.

12:30.600 --> 12:32.930
The Wei family's case will be solved soon.

12:33.480 --> 12:34.880
As for what you did before

12:35.670 --> 12:36.790
or where you came from,

12:36.790 --> 12:37.520
I don't care.

12:38.440 --> 12:40.040
As long as you never deceive,

12:40.360 --> 12:40.950
cheat,

12:41.630 --> 12:42.890
or hide things from me,

12:43.000 --> 12:43.860
that's enough.

12:49.840 --> 12:50.910
He asked

12:51.750 --> 12:53.480
who Mr. Yang had conflicts with

12:53.750 --> 12:54.790
and who in Xinfang Pavilion

12:54.790 --> 12:55.910
might be suspects.

12:56.510 --> 12:57.910
I just told him the truth.

12:59.840 --> 13:01.770
He didn't ask about anything else?

13:03.360 --> 13:05.440
He also asked about
my background and origins,

13:05.440 --> 13:07.500
but I managed to evade the questions.

13:16.000 --> 13:17.320
I wonder if they found

13:17.320 --> 13:18.720
the owner of those shoes.

13:18.960 --> 13:20.090
Adult women's shoes

13:20.240 --> 13:22.320
with phoenix or flower designs
on the sole are common,

13:22.320 --> 13:24.840
but those carved with
the Five Poisons are rare.

13:24.840 --> 13:27.000
They're more like what's used
during the Dragon Boat Festival

13:27.000 --> 13:28.510
to ward off evil.

13:31.320 --> 13:33.080
There are no children with seven-cun feet

13:33.080 --> 13:33.810
in my family.

13:37.150 --> 13:37.750
Wait a sec.

13:41.360 --> 13:42.160
You may go now.

13:47.440 --> 13:49.960
They don't seem to be searching for shoes
or matching footprints,

13:49.960 --> 13:51.360
but looking for someone.

13:52.200 --> 13:53.600
With a clear conscience,

13:54.320 --> 13:55.780
why fear any questioning?

14:08.120 --> 14:09.630
Keep an eye on these people.

14:09.630 --> 14:11.720
You mean, Lord Lang?

14:14.440 --> 14:15.300
And Lu Fusheng.

14:17.430 --> 14:18.840
The courtyard is in chaos,

14:18.840 --> 14:21.750
yet Miss Rong is still
concerned about the accounts.

14:21.750 --> 14:22.900
When you went out earlier,

14:22.900 --> 14:25.100
did you notice how others looked at you?

14:25.120 --> 14:26.180
They were jealous!

14:26.600 --> 14:28.360
Mr. Lu, I heard them saying

14:28.910 --> 14:29.480
the Yang family

14:29.480 --> 14:31.200
is making a big deal
about Mr. Yang's situation

14:31.200 --> 14:32.360
because they want to marry Yitang

14:32.360 --> 14:33.560
into the Rong family.

14:33.910 --> 14:35.510
Who's been gossiping again?

14:35.870 --> 14:37.030
Yang Dingchen died suddenly.

14:37.030 --> 14:37.790
If someone else

14:37.790 --> 14:38.790
marries into the Rong family,

14:38.790 --> 14:40.200
the connection between two families
will weaken.

14:40.200 --> 14:42.280
How could the Yang family accept that?

14:42.280 --> 14:44.010
All that scheming for nothing.

14:45.270 --> 14:46.600
Mr. Lu, wait for me!

14:48.240 --> 14:48.870
Mr. Lu!

14:49.820 --> 14:50.790
Haven't seen you for a while.

14:50.790 --> 14:52.590
You've clearly become wealthy.

14:53.150 --> 14:53.630
Tell me.

14:54.080 --> 14:54.910
When are you going to pay

14:54.910 --> 14:55.970
the debt you owe us?

14:56.240 --> 14:57.300
Who are you people?

14:57.750 --> 14:59.350
When did I ever owe you money?

14:59.520 --> 15:01.690
A year ago at Jixiang Casino.

15:02.030 --> 15:03.440
You pawned your house and land.

15:03.440 --> 15:05.390
Then borrowed more from us brothers.

15:05.390 --> 15:06.320
With principal and interest,

15:06.320 --> 15:07.910
it's at least 500 taels by now.

15:07.910 --> 15:08.840
You dare refuse to pay?

15:08.840 --> 15:10.000
What scoundrels are you?

15:10.000 --> 15:11.670
Where's the debt note
with his fingerprint?

15:11.670 --> 15:13.530
You're just trying to extort him.

15:13.750 --> 15:14.280
The note?

15:14.480 --> 15:15.810
Yes, I'll get it for you.

15:17.030 --> 15:17.790
I'll get it.

15:18.290 --> 15:19.160
-Take him away.
-Jundai.

15:19.160 --> 15:20.080
-Take him away.
-Jundai.

15:20.080 --> 15:22.210
Move! We'll talk at the County Office.

15:22.290 --> 15:22.770
Mr. Lu!

15:23.320 --> 15:23.790
Mr. Lu!

15:25.910 --> 15:26.510
Come here.

15:29.910 --> 15:31.150
Gentlemen, you didn't explain clearly

15:31.150 --> 15:32.270
before dragging me here.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.500
That's quite rude.

15:55.580 --> 15:57.150
Lord Lu, don't blame us
for being ruthless.

15:57.150 --> 15:58.220
You should have died earlier.

15:58.220 --> 15:58.890
Since you're so hard to kill,

15:58.890 --> 16:00.950
you'll just have to suffer more cuts.

16:04.130 --> 16:05.460
Someone's coming! Run!

16:09.620 --> 16:10.790
Mr. Lu! Mr. Lu!

16:10.790 --> 16:11.390
Don't run!

16:13.080 --> 16:14.120
I failed to protect you properly,

16:14.120 --> 16:15.450
letting you suffer greatly.

16:15.450 --> 16:16.380
I deserve to die.

16:16.670 --> 16:17.800
Why are you all here?

16:18.000 --> 16:18.670
Miss Rong said

16:18.670 --> 16:20.200
the mansion has been unsettled lately.

16:20.200 --> 16:21.200
She feared that you

16:21.200 --> 16:22.500
might get into trouble going out alone.

16:22.500 --> 16:23.750
She ordered us to protect you secretly.

16:23.750 --> 16:25.240
Thankfully they came quickly,

16:25.240 --> 16:26.200
otherwise I wouldn't have the face

16:26.200 --> 16:27.270
to see Miss Rong again.

16:27.270 --> 16:28.200
I was terrified.

16:28.870 --> 16:30.270
It's fine. Let's go.

16:30.510 --> 16:31.770
Mr. Lu, let me help you.

16:34.360 --> 16:35.690
Mr. Lu, you're injured.

16:36.920 --> 16:37.450
Let's go.

16:39.850 --> 16:41.860
[Rong Mansion]

16:50.910 --> 16:51.570
Let me do it.

16:52.580 --> 16:53.180
Miss Rong.

17:01.510 --> 17:02.440
It's my fault.

17:03.790 --> 17:05.550
You got hurt because of me again.

17:05.550 --> 17:07.150
How could this be your fault?

17:11.109 --> 17:12.880
No, it is my fault.

17:13.839 --> 17:16.099
I should have told you the truth earlier.

17:17.640 --> 17:19.040
Your name is Lu Jianglai.

17:19.819 --> 17:22.609
You're the Imperial Inspector
sent by the Emperor to Jiangnan.

17:22.609 --> 17:25.069
You fell off a cliff
due to someone's scheme.

17:25.140 --> 17:27.369
I was afraid
you might have ulterior motives,

17:27.369 --> 17:28.970
so I was constantly on guard.

17:29.680 --> 17:30.270
Only when I was certain

17:30.270 --> 17:32.120
that you truly remembered nothing,

17:32.120 --> 17:33.580
did I finally feel at ease.

17:41.400 --> 17:43.720
The debt of saving my life is immense.

17:44.750 --> 17:45.950
If it weren't for you,

17:46.280 --> 17:47.480
there probably wouldn't be

17:47.480 --> 17:50.210
a person named Lu Jianglai
in this world anymore.

17:50.550 --> 17:53.590
Besides, I was still
recovering from my injuries then.

17:53.590 --> 17:54.850
I would be defenseless

17:55.110 --> 17:55.750
if you had pushed me

17:55.750 --> 17:56.720
out the door.

17:57.270 --> 17:58.530
It would have been easy

17:58.590 --> 17:59.350
to kill me.

18:01.350 --> 18:02.510
I don't want to waste

18:02.880 --> 18:05.280
your two hundred-year-old ginseng roots.

18:08.320 --> 18:09.400
That Lang Zhusheng

18:10.510 --> 18:11.840
is probably a greedy man

18:12.360 --> 18:14.590
who betrayed his master for personal gain.

18:14.590 --> 18:15.790
For fame and fortune,

18:16.240 --> 18:17.220
he sold you, his master,

18:17.220 --> 18:18.680
to that scoundrel Xu Song.

18:19.200 --> 18:21.070
The two of them conspired together

18:21.070 --> 18:22.880
to make you
fall off a cliff and lose your memory,

18:22.880 --> 18:24.270
and then hurriedly
reported your death to the capital

18:24.270 --> 18:25.600
to confirm your demise.

18:26.330 --> 18:28.190
Even if you leave the Rong family,

18:28.590 --> 18:31.110
no one would dare recognize you
as Lu Jianglai.

18:31.110 --> 18:32.160
Yesterday, Lang Zhusheng

18:32.160 --> 18:33.420
saw you in the mansion.

18:33.650 --> 18:35.250
He pretended not to know you,

18:35.640 --> 18:38.030
but privately detained you
for questioning.

18:38.030 --> 18:40.550
After confirming you truly don't remember
your past,

18:40.550 --> 18:42.950
he simply set
his poisonous plan for today.

18:43.000 --> 18:44.590
He planned to silence you permanently

18:44.590 --> 18:46.450
to eliminate any future trouble.

18:46.740 --> 18:47.310
This...

18:50.510 --> 18:51.770
That isn't true, is it?

18:51.850 --> 18:52.920
I had

18:52.920 --> 18:54.550
the Jixiang Casino investigated,

18:54.550 --> 18:56.680
but found no trace of those criminals.

18:57.090 --> 18:58.150
Even at this point,

18:58.890 --> 19:01.350
you still don't believe
he wants to harm you?

19:07.590 --> 19:08.880
I feel dizzy.

19:10.350 --> 19:12.010
Sometimes I remember things,

19:12.790 --> 19:14.520
but other times it's all a blur.

19:15.110 --> 19:17.310
If you hadn't sent people to protect me,

19:18.720 --> 19:19.550
I would've...

19:24.480 --> 19:26.140
He's very guilty-conscious.

19:26.720 --> 19:29.180
From now on,
take more guards when you go out.

19:30.030 --> 19:32.090
As long as
you remain part of the Rong family,

19:32.090 --> 19:34.620
I don't believe he would dare harm you
openly.

20:29.710 --> 20:30.160
Wait.

20:30.920 --> 20:31.920
Are you just leaving like this?

20:31.920 --> 20:33.270
Shanbao will inevitably suspect me.

20:33.270 --> 20:34.340
Your life is what matters most.

20:34.340 --> 20:35.290
Then come with me now

20:35.290 --> 20:36.130
and leave the mansion together.

20:36.130 --> 20:36.930
I can't leave.

20:39.830 --> 20:42.090
The case of Wei family is still unsolved.

20:44.400 --> 20:45.260
Look at my face.

20:45.330 --> 20:46.240
That fiery lady

20:46.240 --> 20:47.440
spat right in my face.

20:47.630 --> 20:48.510
I've never seen

20:48.510 --> 20:49.920
such a fierce woman in my life.

20:49.920 --> 20:50.640
And she's merely

20:50.640 --> 20:52.070
a cousin staying with the Rong family,

20:52.070 --> 20:53.330
yet she's so arrogant.

20:53.750 --> 20:54.920
It's clear that Miss Rong

20:54.920 --> 20:56.480
will be even harder to deceive.

20:56.480 --> 20:59.080
Do you really want to
pluck a tiger's whiskers？

20:59.640 --> 21:00.680
All right, all right.

21:00.680 --> 21:01.880
I have my own methods.

21:13.030 --> 21:14.830
Miss Rong is usually cold as ice,

21:14.880 --> 21:16.310
who knew she could care for someone?

21:16.310 --> 21:18.310
Mr. Lu, it's a blessing in disguise.

21:35.030 --> 21:36.430
This isn't right either.

21:36.480 --> 21:37.210
Not this one.

21:37.590 --> 21:38.120
Not this.

21:41.680 --> 21:43.540
How long will this checking take?

21:45.640 --> 21:46.500
Steward Cheng.

21:47.200 --> 21:47.830
Officer.

21:48.440 --> 21:49.680
You just need to check the size

21:49.680 --> 21:50.440
in the ledger.

21:50.440 --> 21:51.790
Why make such a fuss?

21:52.270 --> 21:54.200
These people still have work to do.

21:54.240 --> 21:55.600
We can't afford the delay.

21:55.600 --> 21:56.530
My Lord said that

21:56.890 --> 21:57.750
since girls and boys

21:57.750 --> 21:58.550
around 15 or 16

21:58.650 --> 21:59.380
grow so fast,

22:00.030 --> 22:01.160
we need to look...

22:01.590 --> 22:02.960
To look for a steed with its portrait.

22:02.960 --> 22:03.890
Yes, for a steed.

22:05.590 --> 22:07.230
The ledger is from last autumn.

22:07.230 --> 22:09.560
Trying to match things now might not work.

22:15.000 --> 22:15.600
Miss Rong.

22:22.510 --> 22:23.110
Miss Rong.

22:23.350 --> 22:24.360
They've gone too far.

22:24.360 --> 22:26.270
They've even searched Hualin Courtyard.

22:26.270 --> 22:27.070
Should we...?

22:27.790 --> 22:29.510
Since Grandmother has given her orders,

22:29.510 --> 22:30.970
let them do as they please.

22:31.270 --> 22:33.530
I'll head back to the
tea plantation now.

22:33.750 --> 22:36.080
The carriage is already prepared for you.

22:36.990 --> 22:39.260
Xiu Qiong, you stay.

22:45.430 --> 22:46.310
They took

22:46.310 --> 22:47.370
shoemaking ledger

22:47.590 --> 22:48.030
and went to

22:48.030 --> 22:49.550
question Mrs. Cui from Zhegui Courtyard,

22:49.550 --> 22:50.830
interrogating her thoroughly,

22:50.830 --> 22:52.440
and insisting she was suspicious.

22:52.440 --> 22:54.030
Miss Shen immediately lost her temper

22:54.030 --> 22:55.160
and had them chased out

22:55.160 --> 22:56.200
with a big broom.

22:56.830 --> 22:58.680
Lord Lang personally pleaded with her

22:58.680 --> 23:00.070
but was scolded terribly too.

23:00.070 --> 23:00.680
They should know better

23:00.680 --> 23:01.640
who we are.

23:02.030 --> 23:02.790
Without any evidence,

23:02.790 --> 23:04.310
they dare to barge in like this.

23:04.310 --> 23:06.110
If they end up finding no evidence,

23:06.110 --> 23:07.000
our Second Master in the capital

23:07.000 --> 23:09.060
can have even the Prefect impeached.

23:09.820 --> 23:10.680
Fortunately, the harvest
at the tea plantation

23:10.680 --> 23:12.480
has finished before the Grain Rain.

23:12.480 --> 23:14.330
If the tea production had been delayed,

23:14.330 --> 23:16.460
Grandmother would have been truly furious.

23:16.460 --> 23:18.790
Those people are making such a commotion.

23:19.310 --> 23:21.590
I heard those women
in the courtyard gossiping

23:21.590 --> 23:23.680
that those people kept staring at them

23:23.680 --> 23:24.920
with strange looks.

23:26.030 --> 23:28.430
If they're really looking for the culprit,

23:29.200 --> 23:31.460
I don't think that's what they're after.

23:35.310 --> 23:36.370
I just remembered!

23:36.550 --> 23:37.070
Yunxi.

23:37.750 --> 23:38.590
I knew I'd seen those shoes

23:38.590 --> 23:39.650
somewhere before.

23:40.590 --> 23:42.250
They belonged to Rong Yunwan!

23:42.920 --> 23:43.980
They're Wanwan's.

23:44.510 --> 23:46.510
I'll go tell Grandmother right away.

23:46.510 --> 23:46.970
Not now.

23:49.200 --> 23:51.260
Rong Yunwan was born simple-minded.

23:51.400 --> 23:53.440
It's not strange that she wanders around.

23:53.440 --> 23:54.880
Besides, you two

23:55.160 --> 23:57.030
are at each other's throats all the time.

23:57.030 --> 23:58.630
If you make a fuss about this,

23:58.870 --> 24:00.480
and implicate the Rong family,

24:00.480 --> 24:02.410
Grandmother will blame you for it.

24:06.480 --> 24:07.680
We'd better wait a bit

24:08.030 --> 24:09.560
and see how things develop.

24:25.440 --> 24:26.440
Did you hear that?

24:27.510 --> 24:28.270
Yes.

24:29.000 --> 24:30.830
That night when I hosted the tea party,

24:30.830 --> 24:32.400
you left early...

24:32.770 --> 24:33.450
Lady Yunxi,

24:34.110 --> 24:35.840
please don't get me in trouble.

24:36.670 --> 24:37.870
Our He's tea shop

24:38.000 --> 24:38.440
is located

24:38.440 --> 24:40.370
just west of your Shanju Tea House.

24:40.440 --> 24:42.590
The first batch of tea
has just been harvested over there.

24:42.590 --> 24:43.640
As a young master,

24:43.750 --> 24:45.680
how could I not make an appearance?

24:46.200 --> 24:48.260
It's not like I am sold to your family.

24:49.550 --> 24:50.080
Sit down.

24:56.070 --> 24:57.540
You're holding such leverage

24:57.540 --> 24:58.710
over Rong Shanbao.

25:00.000 --> 25:01.730
Don't you want to make use of it?

25:02.710 --> 25:04.160
The leverage I have

25:04.200 --> 25:05.590
is far more than you think.

25:05.590 --> 25:07.050
It's not time to use it yet.

25:08.200 --> 25:09.600
So cautious, aren't you?

25:11.160 --> 25:12.200
What if I told you

25:13.110 --> 25:14.110
I could help you

25:14.110 --> 25:15.830
bring that formidable Miss Rong down

25:15.830 --> 25:16.910
from her pedestal?

25:19.070 --> 25:20.070
I'm all ears.

25:22.790 --> 25:24.320
Lady Yune painted a picture

25:24.350 --> 25:26.510
and asked me to embroider
a fruit and vegetable wall hanging.

25:26.510 --> 25:28.200
The peaches and plums
are easy to embroider,

25:28.200 --> 25:29.480
but the eggplants and Buddha's hands

25:29.480 --> 25:30.880
are really tricky for me.

25:30.920 --> 25:32.110
I know your special embroidery stitch

25:32.110 --> 25:33.170
is the finest here,

25:33.350 --> 25:34.550
so I came to you first.

25:34.830 --> 25:35.880
Miss Rong's favored maid,

25:35.880 --> 25:37.200
Xiu Qiong,

25:37.200 --> 25:38.270
is the one with the best needlework.

25:38.270 --> 25:39.450
Why don't you ask her instead?

25:39.450 --> 25:40.820
I don't like her.

25:41.070 --> 25:42.160
I only like you.

25:50.160 --> 25:52.000
Lady Yunxi, Lady Yune,

25:53.110 --> 25:54.310
what brings you here?

25:54.550 --> 25:56.110
Yunxi invited you here

25:56.440 --> 25:58.640
because she has something for you to do.

26:02.590 --> 26:04.650
I've always said Manzhu is talented.

26:04.830 --> 26:07.430
She's determined to
take you into her service.

26:10.330 --> 26:12.390
I don't deserve Lady Yunxi's praise.

26:13.590 --> 26:14.830
Last December,

26:15.580 --> 26:18.200
when you helped Miss Rong
with the New Year gifts,

26:18.200 --> 26:20.460
you took quite a few “gifts”,
didn't you?

26:20.880 --> 26:24.120
I wonder if Miss Rong knows about that?

26:42.480 --> 26:43.750
Look at this girl.

26:44.440 --> 26:45.680
She's terrified.

26:48.400 --> 26:49.240
Don't worry,

26:49.880 --> 26:51.740
I just need you to do a small favor.

26:52.000 --> 26:54.130
I won't make things difficult for you.

27:02.400 --> 27:03.000
Yeju,

27:03.350 --> 27:04.470
I was just about to look for you.

27:04.470 --> 27:04.960
At the back door,

27:04.960 --> 27:06.090
that peddler has come again.

27:06.090 --> 27:07.070
The pearl hairpin

27:07.070 --> 27:07.880
and red silk handkerchief you want

27:07.880 --> 27:09.070
have all been brought.

27:09.070 --> 27:10.920
Everyone's picking through them now.

27:10.920 --> 27:13.160
Xiang'er, I still have business here.

27:13.480 --> 27:15.340
What business could be so urgent?

27:15.400 --> 27:15.930
Let's go.

27:16.150 --> 27:16.430
I...

27:16.450 --> 27:17.240
Come on.

27:17.930 --> 27:19.470
That damned Lang Zhusheng,

27:19.880 --> 27:21.160
a pretentious scholar

27:21.160 --> 27:22.030
out of nowhere,

27:22.350 --> 27:24.030
made mountain out of a molehill,

27:24.030 --> 27:25.490
causing such a commotion.

27:25.510 --> 27:27.570
And Grandmother even tolerates him.

27:28.830 --> 27:30.360
Xiangling, don't be upset.

27:30.830 --> 27:32.260
Our Rong family has had a death case.

27:32.260 --> 27:33.750
To quell public gossip,

27:33.830 --> 27:35.090
and placate the Yangs,

27:35.240 --> 27:36.590
we have to at least
make a show of cooperating.

27:36.590 --> 27:38.000
Besides, Magistrate Lang

27:38.000 --> 27:39.460
is only following orders.

27:39.550 --> 27:40.910
Look how cautious he is being.

27:40.910 --> 27:42.040
He's quite pitiful.

27:42.590 --> 27:43.520
You are actually

27:43.730 --> 27:45.530
speaking up for an outsider now.

27:49.160 --> 27:49.760
Miss Shen,

27:49.920 --> 27:52.180
the letter has been delivered to Mr. Bai.

27:53.160 --> 27:54.920
That floral hairpin in your hair
looks pretty.

27:54.920 --> 27:56.380
Come closer and let me see.

27:59.070 --> 28:00.030
The pearl hairpin

28:00.030 --> 28:01.430
was snatched by Yang'er.

28:01.590 --> 28:03.030
I was flustered in the moment

28:03.030 --> 28:04.510
and couldn't hold off so many of them.

28:04.510 --> 28:06.640
So I only managed to grab this small one.

28:06.640 --> 28:08.270
It's quite exquisitely made.

28:08.270 --> 28:09.130
Who's Yang'er?

28:09.750 --> 28:11.000
She's the needleworker

28:11.000 --> 28:12.200
from Lady Yunxi's courtyard.

28:12.200 --> 28:13.310
Three or four of them came,

28:13.310 --> 28:14.890
surrounded me and wouldn't let go.

28:14.890 --> 28:16.240
Tell me everything that happened today,

28:16.240 --> 28:17.400
in exact detail.

28:17.470 --> 28:18.930
Not a single word omitted.

28:19.160 --> 28:19.640
Yes.

28:26.790 --> 28:27.400
Yunshu.

28:28.800 --> 28:29.930
Where are you going?

28:30.880 --> 28:32.880
The last batch of first spring tea
has been picked.

28:32.880 --> 28:33.750
All the fresh tea from every plantation

28:33.750 --> 28:35.030
needs to be sent to Hualin Courtyard.

28:35.030 --> 28:36.360
I'm going to check on it.

28:37.240 --> 28:38.970
She went to the tea plantation.

28:39.480 --> 28:39.960
I see.

28:44.850 --> 28:47.110
What's going on with Yunxi's people now?

28:48.350 --> 28:49.640
So many account books and letters.

28:49.640 --> 28:51.540
How long will it take
to go through them all?

28:51.540 --> 28:52.240
Your mistress

28:52.240 --> 28:53.830
is rushed off her feet every day.

28:53.830 --> 28:54.890
Look how late it is,

28:55.000 --> 28:56.760
but she's still not back
from the tea plantation.

28:56.760 --> 28:57.890
Just think about it.

28:58.030 --> 28:58.790
Running such a large family business

28:58.790 --> 28:59.650
is no easy task.

29:00.570 --> 29:01.630
What's the big deal

29:01.890 --> 29:03.400
about sharing a little of her burden?

29:03.400 --> 29:05.160
Mr. Lu, you really care for her.

29:09.350 --> 29:10.750
Look, isn't that Mr. Bai?

29:11.470 --> 29:12.480
That servant leading the way

29:12.480 --> 29:13.410
looks familiar.

29:13.830 --> 29:14.690
Do you know him?

29:15.110 --> 29:15.790
That's

29:15.990 --> 29:17.470
He Si, who serves Mr. He.

29:19.430 --> 29:21.370
He Xingming and Bai Yingsheng

29:21.400 --> 29:22.360
are like fire and water.

29:22.360 --> 29:23.890
How could they be together?

29:24.200 --> 29:25.240
You didn't see wrong?

29:25.240 --> 29:26.310
No mistake about it.

29:26.310 --> 29:26.830
That He Si

29:26.830 --> 29:28.310
loves gambling more than anything.

29:28.310 --> 29:30.680
Whenever we servants
feel like a little gamble,

29:30.680 --> 29:31.810
he's always around.

29:32.160 --> 29:33.160
Go quickly and see

29:33.270 --> 29:34.070
if He Xingming

29:34.140 --> 29:35.480
is looking to cause trouble
for Bai Yingsheng.

29:35.480 --> 29:36.880
Report back to me at once.

29:39.830 --> 29:40.890
I'll be right back.

29:47.930 --> 29:48.520
Mr. Lu.

29:48.920 --> 29:49.750
This evening, Mr. He

29:49.750 --> 29:51.810
ordered a table of fine food and wine.

29:53.070 --> 29:55.480
He Xingming is hosting Bai Yingsheng?

29:57.640 --> 29:59.100
Now that's something new.

30:02.200 --> 30:03.400
Mr. Bai, come on,

30:03.790 --> 30:04.650
have some more.

30:11.590 --> 30:13.050
Bring another pot of wine!

30:18.880 --> 30:19.550
Mr. He.

30:20.380 --> 30:21.450
It's getting late.

30:22.030 --> 30:23.680
I need study later,

30:24.090 --> 30:25.530
so I really can't drink anymore.

30:25.530 --> 30:26.990
If you don't drink my wine,

30:27.420 --> 30:29.790
it means
you're still holding a grudge against me.

30:29.790 --> 30:30.590
That's not it.

30:31.280 --> 30:32.340
In this world,

30:32.960 --> 30:34.200
there's no one more magnanimous

30:34.200 --> 30:35.200
than you, Mr. He.

30:38.740 --> 30:40.830
I'm flattered.

30:41.920 --> 30:45.270
My verbal agreement with Lady Yunshu

30:45.270 --> 30:47.350
doesn't make us truly married.

30:48.000 --> 30:50.270
Since I can change my betrothal
to Lady Yunxi now,

30:50.270 --> 30:51.450
why don't I allow you two

30:51.450 --> 30:52.640
who have feelings for each other

30:52.640 --> 30:53.770
form your own match?

30:54.560 --> 30:56.560
Lady Yunxi kindly advised me today.

30:57.070 --> 30:58.680
In the future, when you marry Lady Yunshu,

30:58.680 --> 31:00.400
we'll become brothers-in-law!

31:00.400 --> 31:02.070
Both under the Rong roof,

31:02.310 --> 31:04.480
we're bound to help each other out.

31:05.000 --> 31:06.930
Why be enemies?

31:12.200 --> 31:12.850
Mr. He,

31:14.830 --> 31:16.230
a true gentleman indeed.

31:17.200 --> 31:18.160
But I really

31:18.160 --> 31:19.290
have something to do later,

31:19.290 --> 31:20.950
because I have an appointment

31:21.370 --> 31:23.020
with Lady Yunshu.

31:26.600 --> 31:27.360
Alright.

31:28.660 --> 31:30.860
I won't delay your
important business.

31:37.160 --> 31:38.820
Let's have three more drinks.

31:39.030 --> 31:39.690
From now on,

31:40.240 --> 31:42.350
let's put our grudges behind us

31:42.680 --> 31:44.140
and renew our friendship.

31:51.720 --> 31:53.640
Lady Yunwan, don't be upset anymore.

31:53.640 --> 31:54.700
Look at what I have.

31:55.310 --> 31:56.030
I don't want it.

31:56.030 --> 31:56.920
I only want Mrs. Liang!

31:56.920 --> 31:58.160
I only want Mrs. Liang!

31:58.160 --> 31:58.960
Lady Yunwan,

32:04.880 --> 32:05.720
these are all specially

32:05.720 --> 32:07.030
found for you by Miss Rong.

32:07.030 --> 32:08.510
Let's stop making a fuss, shall we?

32:08.510 --> 32:09.440
No more fussing.

32:12.590 --> 32:14.240
Lady Yunwan, it's alright.

32:14.510 --> 32:15.590
Mrs. Liang will come back.

32:15.590 --> 32:16.170
Well...

32:16.200 --> 32:16.740
isn't that nice?

32:16.740 --> 32:17.990
How could you break

32:18.010 --> 32:19.480
the teacups given by Lady Rong!

32:19.480 --> 32:20.240
You were the one who broke them.

32:20.240 --> 32:21.500
Enough, stop arguing.

32:21.830 --> 32:23.360
What's happening outside?

32:23.550 --> 32:24.210
Move aside.

32:27.400 --> 32:29.110
When I was going to get bird's nest soup
for Lady Yunwan,

32:29.110 --> 32:29.680
I saw two women

32:29.680 --> 32:31.000
arguing in the kitchen.

32:31.000 --> 32:32.200
I tried to reason with them,

32:32.200 --> 32:33.750
but they started fighting instead.

32:33.750 --> 32:34.400
Just look!

32:34.680 --> 32:35.440
I was just trying to separate them,

32:35.440 --> 32:37.040
and they even pulled my hair!

32:37.160 --> 32:38.160
Go check quickly.

32:38.300 --> 32:39.370
With that sharp tongue of yours,

32:39.370 --> 32:40.830
you always pour oil on the fire.

32:40.830 --> 32:42.080
Miss Rong will be back soon.

32:42.080 --> 32:43.590
What will happen if she finds out?

32:43.590 --> 32:43.920
You stay here

32:43.920 --> 32:45.780
and take good care of Lady Yunwan.

32:54.030 --> 32:54.890
It's scalding!

32:54.960 --> 32:56.350
Go get a cooling fan.

32:56.880 --> 32:57.680
A cooling fan?

32:57.700 --> 32:59.030
Don't you know what a cooling fan is?

32:59.030 --> 33:00.020
Mrs. Qiu put them away.

33:00.020 --> 33:01.020
Go ask her for one.

33:01.110 --> 33:01.510
Yes.

33:16.240 --> 33:16.970
Lady Yunwan?

33:19.310 --> 33:20.040
Lady Yunwan?

33:21.590 --> 33:22.750
If you eat it up,

33:23.240 --> 33:24.720
I'll take you to see Mrs. Liang.

33:24.720 --> 33:25.580
How about that?

33:27.030 --> 33:27.510
Really?

33:32.720 --> 33:33.240
Mr. Bai?

33:34.790 --> 33:35.640
Mr. Bai?

33:51.960 --> 33:52.810
Idiot.

33:57.180 --> 33:58.590
Time to make our move.

34:17.630 --> 34:18.159
Let's go.

34:23.580 --> 34:24.310
Lady Yunwan,

34:24.590 --> 34:26.590
Mrs. Liang is waiting for you there.

34:31.510 --> 34:32.920
Didn't you two used to

34:32.920 --> 34:34.360
play hide-and-seek here?

34:34.360 --> 34:35.090
Hurry up now.

35:05.710 --> 35:06.710
Mrs. Liang?

35:39.090 --> 35:39.960
Lady Yunwan.

35:42.320 --> 35:43.280
Lady Yunwan.

35:51.880 --> 35:52.610
Who's there?

35:52.710 --> 35:53.240
Who is it?

35:54.000 --> 35:54.510
Stop!

35:57.030 --> 35:59.150
Help! Someone help!

35:59.150 --> 35:59.550
Go!

36:00.510 --> 36:02.070
Lady Yunwan. Lady Yunwan.

36:02.590 --> 36:03.590
Come and help quickly!

36:03.590 --> 36:04.510
Help!

36:04.670 --> 36:05.920
Save Lady Yunwan!

36:06.590 --> 36:07.320
Lady Yunwan!

36:07.800 --> 36:08.550
Lady Yunwan!

36:09.760 --> 36:11.150
Hurry to Chongxi Hall
and inform Lady Rong!

36:11.150 --> 36:12.150
Something terrible
has happened to Lady Yunwan!

36:12.150 --> 36:12.670
Go now!

36:13.090 --> 36:13.940
-Go!
-Yes.

36:15.110 --> 36:15.640
Let's go!

36:16.190 --> 36:16.920
Lady Yunwan!

36:21.230 --> 36:21.920
Lady Rong!

36:23.230 --> 36:23.880
Lady Rong!

36:28.190 --> 36:28.800
Lady Rong!

36:29.710 --> 36:30.840
Lady Yunwan is gone.

36:51.200 --> 36:51.710
Mr. Bai!

36:52.320 --> 36:53.550
Mr. Bai! Wake up!

36:54.360 --> 36:55.220
Bai Yingsheng!

37:04.620 --> 37:06.150
Bai Yingsheng! Wake up now!

37:07.320 --> 37:08.430
Pull yourself together!

37:08.430 --> 37:09.430
Wake up right now!

37:10.800 --> 37:12.230
Mr. Lu! Mr. Lu!

37:16.840 --> 37:18.070
Miss Rong is surrounded in the garden!

37:18.070 --> 37:19.600
Lady Rong has been alerted.

37:20.350 --> 37:21.500
You stay and watch him.

37:21.500 --> 37:22.410
I'll go check the garden first.

37:22.410 --> 37:22.800
Yes.

37:32.400 --> 37:33.200
Grandmother!

37:34.550 --> 37:36.350
Enough! This is no time for that.

37:36.380 --> 37:38.440
Go quickly and see what's happening.

37:38.920 --> 37:40.240
As soon as I got the news,

37:40.240 --> 37:41.510
I was shocked to my core,

37:41.510 --> 37:42.920
completely beside myself.

37:42.920 --> 37:45.120
Only upon seeing you have I calmed down.

37:45.400 --> 37:46.150
The garden is slippery.

37:46.150 --> 37:47.480
Please watch your step.

37:48.400 --> 37:49.070
The Rong family now

37:49.070 --> 37:50.470
depends entirely on you.

37:57.670 --> 37:58.230
Wanwan!

37:59.070 --> 37:59.760
Wanwan!

38:02.800 --> 38:03.480
Wanwan!

38:04.670 --> 38:05.440
Wanwan!

38:07.620 --> 38:08.460
Wanwan!

38:20.750 --> 38:21.580
Miss Rong!

38:22.360 --> 38:23.620
Lady Rong has arrived.

38:28.320 --> 38:31.670
Grandmother, I just arrived home

38:32.830 --> 38:33.620
when I heard

38:35.510 --> 38:36.670
about Wanwan...

38:41.360 --> 38:42.230
Lady Rong,

38:43.120 --> 38:44.710
Mrs. Liang who served Lady Yunwan

38:44.710 --> 38:46.120
fell ill and returned to her hometown.

38:46.120 --> 38:47.710
Lady Yunwan missed her too much,

38:47.710 --> 38:48.280
so she went to their

38:48.280 --> 38:49.880
old play spot to look for her.

38:50.030 --> 38:51.690
By the time we maids found her,

38:53.520 --> 38:54.790
Lady Yunwan had fallen into

38:54.790 --> 38:55.440
the large vat normally used

38:55.440 --> 38:56.650
for collecting rainwater

38:56.650 --> 38:57.380
and drowned.

39:01.320 --> 39:03.180
The wicked live a thousand years.

39:03.450 --> 39:04.650
How could she be dead?

39:06.700 --> 39:07.760
Is she really dead?

39:08.350 --> 39:09.410
I don't believe it.

39:09.550 --> 39:10.880
I need to see for myself.

39:16.150 --> 39:17.710
No matter how much you resent Wanwan,

39:17.710 --> 39:18.840
she's already dead.

39:18.920 --> 39:19.590
Can't you let her

39:19.590 --> 39:20.880
rest in peace?

39:22.110 --> 39:23.840
Quickly pull Lady Yunyin away!

39:27.230 --> 39:29.160
Yunyin, Grandmother is grieving.

39:29.160 --> 39:30.620
Please don't make a scene.

39:39.630 --> 39:42.360
I know you sisters can't bear
to part with Yunwan,

39:42.360 --> 39:43.000
but don't forget

39:43.000 --> 39:44.750
the old rules of the Rong family.

39:44.750 --> 39:46.810
Women shouldn't be involved in this.

39:53.710 --> 39:54.110
Right.

39:54.800 --> 39:56.260
I forgot in the confusion.

39:58.190 --> 39:59.920
Wanwan's face looks terrible.

40:01.630 --> 40:04.030
I wouldn't dare disturb you, Grandmother.

40:04.990 --> 40:06.190
Better take her away.

40:23.110 --> 40:25.240
Is everyone in Hualin Courtyard dead?

40:25.340 --> 40:27.150
Grandmother entrusted Yunwan to you.

40:27.150 --> 40:27.960
Why did you let her

40:27.960 --> 40:28.820
run here alone?

40:28.920 --> 40:30.430
Where were the people
supposed to be with her?

40:30.430 --> 40:31.760
I know she was born

40:31.760 --> 40:32.480
afflicted.

40:32.830 --> 40:34.990
She'd caused so much annoyance to others.

40:34.990 --> 40:36.590
Some have long wished for her death

40:36.590 --> 40:37.920
to be rid of this burden.

40:38.960 --> 40:39.760
It's my fault.

40:40.280 --> 40:41.940
Had I known this would happen,

40:42.150 --> 40:43.110
I should have kept Yunwan

40:43.110 --> 40:44.240
in my own courtyard.

40:44.360 --> 40:45.230
Day and night,

40:45.230 --> 40:46.970
I would have watched over her myself.

40:46.970 --> 40:47.710
I would never have let her

40:47.710 --> 40:49.710
go alone, so desolate and wretched.

40:50.510 --> 40:52.840
Grandmother, my poor Yunwan.

40:53.280 --> 40:54.550
She was so young.

40:55.280 --> 40:56.230
These people

40:56.590 --> 40:57.920
have such cruel hearts.

40:58.510 --> 41:00.360
You claim to care so much for Yunwan,

41:00.360 --> 41:00.800
but in the past year,

41:00.800 --> 41:02.600
you never visited her even once.

41:02.670 --> 41:03.670
Yunwan's drowning

41:03.670 --> 41:05.530
was something no one could have foreseen.

41:05.530 --> 41:06.670
Shanbao was at the tea plantation.

41:06.670 --> 41:08.280
She can't be in two places at once.

41:08.280 --> 41:09.960
You can blame the servants for negligence,

41:09.960 --> 41:10.800
so be it.

41:11.280 --> 41:12.630
But is this insinuation,

41:12.630 --> 41:13.880
necessary here?

41:14.040 --> 41:14.400
You,

41:14.430 --> 41:15.150
Xiangling.

41:17.320 --> 41:19.320
Yun'e is just heartbroken about Yunwan.

41:19.320 --> 41:20.250
She's flustered

41:20.670 --> 41:21.670
and misspoke.

41:22.420 --> 41:23.880
Shanbao will understand.

41:24.660 --> 41:25.500
But tonight,

41:25.840 --> 41:27.070
who was on duty?

41:27.710 --> 41:29.310
How could such a lapse occur?

41:29.760 --> 41:31.360
They must not go unpunished.

41:32.110 --> 41:32.840
Lady Rong.

41:33.110 --> 41:34.370
I was on watch tonight.

41:34.600 --> 41:36.000
Everything is my fault.

41:37.000 --> 41:38.710
I accept whatever punishment you deem fit.

41:38.710 --> 41:40.190
You will be punished, of course.

41:40.190 --> 41:41.320
Stand aside for now.

41:42.710 --> 41:44.570
Where are tonight's patrollers?

41:46.920 --> 41:47.800
Your Ladyship,

41:48.110 --> 41:48.710
when the two of us

41:48.710 --> 41:50.010
were patrolling near the east corner gate,

41:50.010 --> 41:51.550
we glimpsed a figure in the darkness,

41:51.550 --> 41:52.880
dressed like a scholar.

41:53.280 --> 41:54.550
His silhouette looked very familiar.

41:54.550 --> 41:55.150
He was hurrying away,

41:55.150 --> 41:56.320
coming out from the side gate.

41:56.320 --> 41:57.760
The more we called out,
the faster he fled.

41:57.760 --> 41:59.360
We were about to chase after him

41:59.360 --> 42:01.030
when we heard commotion in the garden

42:01.030 --> 42:02.320
and couldn't pursue him further.

42:02.320 --> 42:03.510
Did you get a clear look?

42:03.510 --> 42:04.440
Who it was?

42:05.550 --> 42:06.550
I recognized him.

42:07.070 --> 42:09.130
It was Mr. Bai from Xinfang Pavilion.

42:14.440 --> 42:15.040
Miss Rong.

42:16.400 --> 42:17.590
Go bring him here.

42:18.110 --> 42:18.590
Yes.

42:19.230 --> 42:19.840
Fusheng.

42:33.000 --> 42:33.960
Yunwan

42:35.190 --> 42:36.070
was murdered.

42:55.250 --> 42:55.640
Go.

42:58.220 --> 42:58.650
Go.

43:02.030 --> 43:02.890
Steward Cheng.

43:03.630 --> 43:04.690
What has happened?

43:07.770 --> 43:08.770
Nothing serious.

43:08.920 --> 43:11.050
Lady Rong wishes to speak with Mr. Bai.

43:11.660 --> 43:12.970
Everyone should return first.

43:12.970 --> 43:15.450
Don't wander around tonight.

43:20.850 --> 43:23.020
The Rong family is truly
going through difficult times.

43:23.020 --> 43:24.910
One disaster follows another.

43:26.130 --> 43:26.780
Mr. Yan.

43:37.630 --> 43:38.150
Indeed.

43:38.920 --> 43:39.960
Since ancient times,
fortune rarely comes in pairs,

43:39.960 --> 43:41.380
but misfortune never travels alone.

43:41.380 --> 43:43.780
Too much comfort always leads to calamity.

43:44.510 --> 43:45.560
However, Miss Rong

43:45.560 --> 43:47.220
is blessed with good fortune.

43:48.000 --> 43:50.400
She'll certainly get through this safely.

44:01.310 --> 44:02.770
Lady Rong, Mr. Bai's here.

44:10.040 --> 44:12.350
Was it you who killed my granddaughter?

46:45.270 --> 46:47.490
[Five Poisons and Fortune Pattern]

46:47.880 --> 46:49.190
I wonder if the owner of those shoes

46:49.190 --> 46:50.030
is found.

46:50.780 --> 46:51.820
For adult women,

46:52.110 --> 46:54.080
shoes with phoenix or flower designs
on the sole are common,

46:54.080 --> 46:56.710
but those carved with
the Five Poisons are rare.

46:56.710 --> 46:58.840
They're more like what's used
during the Dragon Boat Festival

46:58.840 --> 47:00.360
to ward off evil.

47:00.590 --> 47:01.670
In ancient times, people believed

47:01.670 --> 47:02.630
the Fifth Lunar Month was a poisonous one,

47:02.630 --> 47:04.710
when insects multiplied
and diseases spread easily.

47:04.710 --> 47:06.530
To help children
safely get through summer,

47:06.530 --> 47:08.230
people commonly had children wear

47:08.230 --> 47:09.280
clothes embroidered with the Five Poisons:

47:09.280 --> 47:11.000
gecko, scorpion, toad,

47:09.680 --> 47:12.030
[Five Poison Pattern]

47:11.510 --> 47:13.510
centipede and snake patterns,

47:13.510 --> 47:16.360
symbolizing
fighting poison with poison for safety.

47:16.360 --> 47:18.380
They also wore
five-colored thread bracelets.

47:18.380 --> 47:19.880
These five colors
correspond to the Five Elements:

47:19.880 --> 47:22.440
Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, and Water.

47:22.460 --> 47:23.300
Ancient people believed

47:23.300 --> 47:24.550
they could balance yin and yang,

47:24.550 --> 47:25.500
prevent illness and extend life,

47:25.500 --> 47:26.880
becoming children's unique

47:26.880 --> 47:28.510
Dragon Boat Festival accessories.

47:28.510 --> 47:30.670
Besides the Dragon Boat Festival's
Five Poisons patterns,

47:30.670 --> 47:31.400
there were also some

47:31.400 --> 47:32.480
common decorative patterns
in ancient times,

47:32.480 --> 47:34.440
such as the twining lotus,

47:32.950 --> 47:35.210
[Eight Fortune Pattern]

47:34.440 --> 47:36.070
symbolizing endless cycles of life,

47:36.070 --> 47:36.840
representing good fortune.

47:36.840 --> 47:38.920
The jade rabbit pattern represents
longevity and health.

47:36.950 --> 47:38.840
[Jade Rabbit Pattern]

47:38.960 --> 47:44.430
[Auspicious Cloud Pattern]

47:39.190 --> 47:41.000
The auspicious cloud pattern
expresses ancient people's

47:41.000 --> 47:42.630
aspiration for a better life.

47:42.630 --> 47:43.800
These are all quite

47:43.800 --> 47:45.320
characteristic patterns
of the Ming Dynasty.

47:45.320 --> 47:46.630
Fairy, palace lantern,

47:46.630 --> 47:47.760
squirrel, fruits,

47:47.760 --> 47:49.920
and camellia patterns also possess
a kind of quaint charm.
